# Prose-word budgets (scripts/doc-form.sh): path=N share=S. The multi-user split (#1519) moved the
# People, governance, capabilities and API-token material out of docs/OPERATIONS.md into twelve task
# pages under docs/operations/; each is budgeted at its measured size, and OPERATIONS.md's budget is
# reduced to its size after the move. Text moved verbatim, so a page's count is what left the shared
# file less its stub lines.
#
# docs/operations/who-gets-in.md=1453 is the "Multi-user: who can change what" preamble, "Who decides
# who gets in: chart vs console vs IdP" and "Wins a collision: chart / env", less the "What admin-only
# still means" block (below) and the page lead.
# docs/operations/admin-only-writes.md=2869 is "**What admin-only still means**" through the ratchet
# paragraph — the `| Surface | Gate |` tier table operations_tier_doc_test.go reads cell by cell.
# docs/operations/three-roles.md=4012 is "Three roles, and who sets the walls", "When everyone is an
# admin, and what a refused person is told" and "UI apps with more than one user: use host mode".
# docs/operations/provider-policy.md=1278 is "Who writes the provider policy: console vs CLI/MDM" and
# its "Clearing a block" sub-block.
# docs/operations/ownership-and-offboarding.md=2370 is the ownership-scoping half of the old section:
# run/workspace/secret ownership, drive offboarding, the credential erase and the ordered offboarding.
# docs/operations/governance-writes.md=2726 is the second-human switches, the four-eyes rules and the
# four-eyes walkthrough.
# docs/operations/member-runs.md=1044 is the credential and egress decision scopes, the member policy
# clamp and the first-run prompts.
# docs/operations/user-drives.md=4804 is "Reclaiming a departed person's storage", "User drives on
# Docker" and their sub-blocks.
# docs/operations/capabilities.md=3861 is "Capabilities: what one member, or one group, may do" and its
# four kind sub-blocks.
# docs/operations/custom-components.md=1184 is "Custom components".
# docs/operations/api-tokens.md=3991 is "Per-user API tokens", "Tokens for a person who never signs in"
# and "Delegated run management (portals)".
# docs/operations/denials.md=4636 is "Every denial that isn't a 404" — the `| reason |` table
# authz_denied_doc_test.go and docs_r3_guard_test.go read.
docs/operations/who-gets-in.md=1453 share=35
docs/operations/admin-only-writes.md=2869 share=35
docs/operations/three-roles.md=4012 share=35
docs/operations/provider-policy.md=1278 share=35
docs/operations/ownership-and-offboarding.md=2370 share=35
docs/operations/governance-writes.md=2726 share=35
